# Frontend build artifacts (built by docker/Dockerfile.web / npm run build)
web/dist/

# Frontend dependencies
web/node_modules/

# Playwright e2e artifacts: HTML report, traces/videos, test results and the
# generated run manifests. They are per-run scratch, and a committed report is
# a report of a run nobody is looking at.
web/playwright-report/
web/test-results/
web/e2e/.nvr-run.json

# Media the running installation writes (segments, clips, snapshots, the
# sqlite dev database) and the ONNX model the detector image exports at build
# time. Neither is source, and the model is a 12 MB binary.
#
# The model directory is anchored to the repo root on purpose: unanchored,
# `models/` also matched `server/models/`, which is a Go package, and Step 1's
# models package went untracked for exactly that reason (card P-05). A pattern
# that ignores source is worse than no pattern.
data/
/models/
*.onnx

# Local deployment config: holds JWT_SECRET / NVR_SECRET_KEY / WORKER_TOKEN.
# Only .env.example is committed.
.env

# scripts/coverage.sh working files
.coverage-*.out

# Files the coding-agent memory tooling writes into the repo root: the memory
# bank's config dump, and the HTTP API spec it fetched into the working tree.
# They belong to this machine's tooling, not to the product, and committing them
# would put a bank config inside an install. Both patterns are root-anchored on
# purpose, for the P-05 reason: unanchored, `spec.json` would also ignore a real
# spec file inside any package (card P-07).
/nvr_cfg2.json
/spec.json

# The coding agent's own session board, written by the DeepSeek Harness kanban
# plugin into the repo root. It is per-machine working state, not the product's
# board: nvrWay's board is kanban/cards/*.md (source of truth) rendered to
# KANBAN.md, and a second board file inside an install would only invite the two
# to disagree. Root-anchored for the P-05 reason — unanchored, `KANBAN.json`
# would also ignore a real one inside any package (card P-07).
/KANBAN.json

# Python packaging / test scratch
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.detector-build/
detector/*.egg-info/

# Local scratch built by scripts/ (fixture downloads, e2e stacks)
.tmp/
testdata/bus.jpg
testdata/yolov8n.pt
testdata/yolov8n.onnx
/.agents/notes/archive.json
